<title>UK: Brit Land sells property worth 140 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Brit Land sells property worth 140 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Land Company Plc said on Friday it had sold a portfolio of office and retail properties to Alony Hetz Property &amp; Investments Ltd for 140 million stg.</p>
</text>
